%I A399460 #9 Sep 12 2026 16:15:24
%S A399460 1,2,2,6,13,602
%N A399460 Number of Chvátal-Erdős graphs with degree n.
%C A399460 A Chvátal-Erdős graph is triangle-free with independence number and connectivity both equal. This implies that it is regular and has diameter 2.
%C A399460 Row sums of table in A399459.
%H A399460 Allan Bickle, Megan Cream and Ron Gould, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.disc.2026.115336">Chorded cycles in Chvátal-Erdős graphs</a>, Discrete Math, 350 (2027), 115336.
%H A399460 A. F. Sidorenko, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0012-365X(91)90114-H">Triangle-free regular graphs</a>, Discrete Math., 91 (1991), 215-217.
%e A399460 For n=1, the only graph is K_2.
%e A399460 For n=2, the two graphs are C_4 and C_5.
%e A399460 For n=3, the two graphs are K_3,3 and M_8.
%Y A399460 Cf. A399459 (table for order n and degree d).
%Y A399460 Cf. A399461 (order n).
%K A399460 nonn,more,new
%O A399460 1,2
%A A399460 _Allan Bickle_, Aug 29 2026
